{"unit_id":"Twofruitsgrape__dsh-comsol#card-zh","repo":"Twofruitsgrape/dsh-comsol","commit":"750a2659281fd93fe784f82f26d205e68b9692d3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-comsol 是面向 DSH 的 COMSOL Multiphysics 技能插件，可从聊天中打开并操作本机模型。它通过 DSH 技能注册入口提供工作流，并调用随包附带的 comsol-mcp 引擎。主要能力包括读取和修改参数、调整求解器、重建网格、运行稳态或瞬态研究并查看进度，还可评估结果、导出绘图并保存模型。适合需要在 DSH 中交互式完成 COMSOL 仿真和查看结果的工程师。使用需要本机 COMSOL 安装及有效许可证、Python 环境和 MCP 包；通常无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:91-103","assets/comsol-dsh/SKILL.md:1-4"]}
{"unit_id":"Twofruitsgrape__dsh-comsol#card-en","repo":"Twofruitsgrape/dsh-comsol","commit":"750a2659281fd93fe784f82f26d205e68b9692d3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-comsol adds a COMSOL skill to DSH. It uses a bundled engine to open local models, edit parameters, rebuild meshes, tune solvers, and run steady or transient studies with progress. Users can evaluate results, export plots, and save models. It requires local COMSOL, a license, Python, and MCP.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:91-103","assets/comsol-dsh/SKILL.md:34-43"]}
